rac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{3}) &  & (\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{4}) &  & (\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{5}) &  & (\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{6}) \\\\  & ⋮ &  & ⋮ &  & ⋮ &  & ⋮ &  & ⋮ &  & ⋮ &  & ⋮ &  & ⋮\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, $(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{4})$ is the sum of the two closest numbers located in the previous row. So,\n\n$$\n(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{4})=(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{5}{3})+(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{5}{4})\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expression is $(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{5}{3}).$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186246939 :answer-field/correct "answer-985886cf-1ac8-5f00-a9b7-a6b8dc16ef03" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fb3123f1-385a-5a7b-84da-6fe907b81043" "answer-d35036c1-6254-594b-a400-43e7b6389e44" "answer-985886cf-1ac8-5f00-a9b7-a6b8dc16ef03" "answer-9bce03e9-173f-5fbc-88bd-7c0cb174aeb3" "answer-d3565fb0-5bc7-5c88-a552-65f6218044f8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fb3123f1-385a-5a7b-84da-6fe907b81043" :answer/id #uuid "fb3123f1-385a-5a7b-84da-6fe907b81043" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{4}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d35036c1-6254-594b-a400-43e7b6389e44" :answer/id #uuid "d35036c1-6254-594b-a400-43e7b6389e44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{4}{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-985886cf-1ac8-5f00-a9b7-a6b8dc16ef03" :answer/id #uuid "985886cf-1ac8-5f00-a9b7-a6b8dc16ef03" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{5}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9bce03e9-173f-5fbc-88bd-7c0cb174aeb3" :answer/id #uuid "9bce03e9-173f-5fbc-88bd-7c0cb174aeb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{5}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d3565fb0-5bc7-5c88-a552-65f6218044f8" :answer/id #uuid "d3565fb0-5bc7-5c88-a552-65f6218044f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{6}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}] "assertions" [[17